🌸 Flowerama | Retail Sales & Profitability Analysis

Excel & Tableau | Financial Analytics | Business Intelligence

📊 Project Overview

This project analyzes the financial and operational performance of a local Flowerama retail store as part of a semester-long business analytics project.

Using Microsoft Excel and Tableau, I tracked revenue, operating expenses, and profit-and-loss performance to better understand the factors influencing store profitability.

The project focused on identifying sales trends, evaluating different order channels, examining operating costs, and translating financial data into meaningful business insights.

The completed analysis was presented at the end of the semester, demonstrating how data visualization and financial reporting can support informed business decisions.

🎯 Project Objectives

Track store revenue, expenses, and profitability.

Identify trends in sales performance throughout the week.

Compare revenue generated through in-store, online, and delivery orders.

Analyze quarterly profit-and-loss performance.

Examine the relationship between revenue and operating expenses.

Evaluate labor costs as a component of total expenses.

Present financial findings through an interactive Tableau dashboard.

🛠️ Tools & Technologies

Tool

